# Read by ripgrep (and tools built on it, incl. Claude's Grep and most editor
# search). NOT read by git. ADR-012 §1.
#
# `.gitignore` excludes /docs/ because the vault is its own repo. Without the
# negation below, every repo-root search silently skips the entire vault — no
# error, and a result set indistinguishable from "no matches".
!docs/
